      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Hines added a central glass atrium below the rink to spotlight lower‑level stores, a design choice that still defines the mall’s layout.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Galleria",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "With 3 million square feet of space and 400 stores, the Galleria is Texas’s largest mall and ranks third in the United States.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Galleria",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Since the COVID‑19 lockdown ended, the Galleria welcomed new tenants such as Rag & Bone, Bally, Savage X Fenty, and the NBA Store.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
